  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: on Tenos</p>\r\n<p>The sanctuary, which is mentioned by Strabo, received special rights from the Phokian Confederation that were later renewed by the Roman emperor Tiberius. The temple itself was executed in the Doric order (6 x 8 columns).</p>",
